  "description": "CR 601.2i, 122.1, 120.3a, 603.7, 707.10, 707.10c: Cursed Recording takes a time counter whenever alice casts an instant or sorcery, and at seven removes them and deals 20 to her; its {T} copies her next instant or sorcery that turn",
  "note": "The Recording starts with five counters. Alice's Lightning Bolt makes six and deals her nothing; bob's Shock at alice in response adds none (alice 27 to 25). After the {T}, alice's Volcanic Hammer, a sorcery, is the seventh: all seven come off (0, not 7, and not 1, as the copy is not cast) and alice takes 20 (to 5); the copy, retargeted at bob, and the original take bob from 16 to 10. Her Shock after it puts one counter back and is not copied (bob to 8).",
